<title>FRANCE: PARIS BOURSE HOLDS GAINS IN LATE TRADE.</title>
<headline>PARIS BOURSE HOLDS GAINS IN LATE TRADE.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>French shares hold  gains in late trade, with CAC bolstered by Alcatel rise on chairman's bullish profit forecast.</p>
<p>* CAC-40 index up 10.27, or 0.37 percent, at 2,749.96 at 1317 GMT</p>
<p>* CAC-40 Jun futures 2,747 vs 2,730 at Thursdays close</p>
<p>* Broader SBF120 index up 6.68 at 1,884.03</p>
